he T15 core implementation is the earlier merged ticket-trailer commit 34998a2ca8 and was re-certified in this environment before epic close."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786593310454110001,"uuid":"2ea838a3-96e6-4b65-90eb-489f0fe673b1"}